			"Message": "style(Wind): Convert ESBuild config indentation to tabs, reorder imports\n\nReformat all ESBuild configuration modules under `Configuration/ESBuild/` to use tab indentation and consistent import-before-declaration ordering. This reverses the 2-space indent convention applied in the previous commit, aligning with the project's PascalCase repository convention for source formatting.\n\nImport statements across BaseConfig, CompileConfig, TargetConfig, and the barrel exports in Target.js, Wind.js, and index.js are regrouped with external/local dependencies separated and declarations placed before `var`/`const` statements. Export blocks in BoundConstant, EnvironmentConstant, and PathConstant are consolidated to single-line style. Trailing commas are added to object and array literals throughout for consistent diff hygiene.\n\nNo functional changes — the build pipeline output is identical.",
			"SHA": "57fa74c17f5dcc6bcf5891cfe194f7361c9aa0ce"
